sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI
    participant Engine as MigrationEngine
    participant Source as SourceDB
    participant AI as AIService
    participant Target as TargetDB
    participant KPI as KPITracker

    User->>CLI: run migration
    activate CLI
    CLI->>Engine: init(source, target, ai)
    activate Engine

    Note over Engine,AI: Phase 1 - Schema Mapping
    Engine->>Source: get_schema()
    Source-->>Engine: DDL and TableSchema list
    Engine->>AI: map_schema(source_ddl, target_dialect)
    activate AI
    Note right of AI: Sends only DDL metadata - no raw data
    AI-->>Engine: SchemaMapping
    deactivate AI
    Engine-->>User: Display mapping for approval
    User->>Engine: Approve mapping

    Note over Engine,AI: Phase 2 - Pre-Flight Sanitization
    Engine->>Source: stream_data(sample, limit=1000)
    Source-->>Engine: ColumnStats list
    Engine->>AI: sanitize_preflight(column_stats)
    activate AI
    Note right of AI: Statistical metadata only - no PII
    AI-->>Engine: SanitizationReport
    deactivate AI
    alt has data issues
        Engine-->>User: Display issues and suggested fixes
        User->>Engine: Confirm proceed
    end

    Note over Engine,KPI: Phase 3 - Migration
    Engine->>Target: disable_constraints()
    Note right of Target: Drop FKs and indexes for speed
    Engine->>KPI: start tracking

    loop For each table
        Engine->>Source: stream_data(table)
        activate Source
        loop Batch of rows
            Source-->>Engine: Row batch
            Engine->>KPI: increment_rows(count)
            Engine->>Target: bulk_insert(table, batch)
            Target-->>Engine: ack
            Engine->>KPI: increment_bytes(size)
        end
        deactivate Source
    end

    Engine->>Target: enable_constraints()
    Note right of Target: Recreate FKs and indexes
    Engine->>KPI: snapshot()
    KPI-->>Engine: KPISnapshot

    Note over Engine,Target: Phase 4 - Integrity Audit
    loop For each table
        Engine->>Source: get_row_count(table)
        Source-->>Engine: source_count
        Engine->>Target: get_row_count(table)
        Target-->>Engine: target_count
    end
    Engine->>Engine: Build AuditReport

    Engine-->>CLI: MigrationResult
    deactivate Engine
    CLI-->>User: Summary with AuditReport and KPI
    deactivate CLI
